    "Name": "Wainreeve",
    "Details": "The Wainreeve is a high-end transport vehicle with enough firepower to protect itself. Originally designed as the replacement for the Star League-era Titanhauler as spare parts started being hard to source during the succession wars. It is able to carry 14 tons of assorted cargo while protected by 11 tons of armor, making it one of the most heavily armored designated cargo transport vehicles seen in the Inner Sphere.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 4/6 hexes / 120/180 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       215     40\n<b>Left</b>         175     40\n<b>Right</b>       175     40\n<b>Rear</b>        140     40\n<b>Turret</b>      175     40\n\n<b>Total</b>      880    200</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Rugged</color>",
